# RIVERTON V1 — COMPREHENSIVE LIFE SIMULATION PLAN

## 1. CORE PHILOSOPHY

- **Age-based time progression** — not just "Year 1, Year 2" but actual aging from birth to death
- **Life-stage-driven gameplay** — childhood, teen, young adult, adult, senior each have completely different mechanics
- **Event-driven world** — the world changes based on what you do, not just your stats
- **Data-driven everything** — all content (events, jobs, careers, NPCs, eras) lives in structured JSON files, not hardcoded Python
- **LLM as narrator, not author** — the engine stays authoritative, the LLM narrates and shapes options

